sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Reconciler as Training Operator<br/>Reconciler
    participant Pods as Training Pods<br/>(Worker/Launcher)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Monitoring
    participant OpenShiftAPI as OpenShift APIServer<br/>config.openshift.io/v1

    Note over Reconciler,OpenShiftAPI: Startup: TLS Profile Derivation
    Reconciler->>OpenShiftAPI: GET APIServer singleton
    alt OpenShift cluster
        OpenShiftAPI-->>Reconciler: TLS profile (min version, cipher suites)
    else Non-OpenShift cluster
        OpenShiftAPI-->>Reconciler: 404 Not Found
        Note over Reconciler: Fallback: TLS 1.2 intermediate<br/>AEAD ciphers (ECDHE+AES-GCM,<br/>ECDHE+ChaCha20)
    end

    Note over Reconciler,Webhook: Startup: Certificate Lifecycle
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: cert-controller generates<br/>self-signed CA + serving cert
    Reconciler->>KubeAPI: Store cert in<br/>training-operator-webhook-cert Secret
    Note over Reconciler: Readiness probe blocks<br/>until certs ready

    Note over User,Pods: Training Job Reconciliation
    User->>KubeAPI: kubectl apply -f pytorchjob.yaml<br/>(CREATE PyTorchJob CR)
    KubeAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-kubeflow-org-v1-pytorchjob<br/>TLS, Fail policy
    Webhook-->>KubeAPI: Admission Response (Allow/Deny)

    alt Admission Allowed
        KubeAPI-->>User: CR created successfully
        KubeAPI->>Reconciler: Watch event: PyTorchJob created
        Reconciler->>KubeAPI: Create Services for job
        Reconciler->>KubeAPI: Create Pods (master + workers)
        KubeAPI-->>Reconciler: Pod status changes (watch)
        Reconciler->>KubeAPI: Update PyTorchJob status<br/>(Running → Succeeded/Failed)
    else Admission Denied
        KubeAPI-->>User: Validation error
    end

    Note over User,Pods: MPI Job (additional resources)
    User->>KubeAPI: kubectl apply -f mpijob.yaml<br/>(CREATE MPIJob CR)
    KubeAPI->>Reconciler: Watch event: MPIJob created
    Reconciler->>KubeAPI: Create ConfigMap (hostfile)
    Reconciler->>KubeAPI: Create ServiceAccount
    Reconciler->>KubeAPI: Create Role + RoleBinding
    Reconciler->>KubeAPI: Create launcher + worker Pods<br/>(kubectl-delivery init container)

    Note over Prometheus,Reconciler: Metrics & Observability
    Prometheus->>Reconciler: GET /metrics<br/>8080/TCP TLS encrypted
    Reconciler-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics response
